NAME Counter Maths Showcase
SET source 1.25
ADD source 0.75
MUL source 2
DIV source 4
SET copy VAR source
FLR lower VAR copy
TOP upper 1.01
SIN sine 30
COS cosine 60
TAN tangent 45
IF VAR lower EQUALS 1 THEN GOTO upper_check ELSE GOTO fail
LABEL upper_check
IF VAR upper EQUALS 2 THEN GOTO sine_check ELSE GOTO fail
LABEL sine_check
IF VAR sine EQUALS VAR cosine THEN GOTO tangent_check ELSE GOTO fail
LABEL tangent_check
IF VAR tangent EQUALS 1 THEN GOTO pass ELSE GOTO fail
LABEL fail
BUTTON B HOLD 300
STOP
LABEL pass
BUTTON A HOLD 300
